00:05:21.623 --> 00:05:23.752
- Three aspects that
came out of the report:

00:05:24.692 --> 00:05:27.938
one, a owner confidentially
told Outside the Lines

00:05:27.938 --> 00:05:29.425
that he thought deflategate was

00:05:29.425 --> 00:05:30.609
a make up call for Spygate.

00:05:30.609 --> 00:05:31.329
- Makes sense.

00:05:31.329 --> 00:05:33.244
