was 40 games worth of tape

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:43.983
at least.

00:05:43.983 --> 00:05:44.864
- Wow.

00:05:44.864 --> 00:05:47.147
- And, there was one other fact.

00:05:48.499 --> 00:05:50.727
Mike Marts, former coach of the Rams,

00:05:50.727 --> 00:05:51.238
- Yes.

00:05:51.238 --> 00:05:53.467
